-- spellings.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  if any flags in the group [model upstream-model] are set none of the others can be; [model upstream-model] were all set; run `aigw add --help`

Impact
  The command could not finish; inspect current state before retrying.

Recommended action
  aigw add --help
-- token.txt --
sk-team-token-0001
-- help.txt --
AIGW  aigw add
────────────────────────────────────────
  Add and connect one Account with its first Route

Usage
  aigw add <account> [flags]

Options
      --anthropic-url string    Anthropic base URL
      --dry-run                 Show the Account, Route and Client Binding that would be added without reading a Token or writing anything
      --for string              Client: claude, claude-desktop, codex, or hermes
  -h, --help                    help for add
      --json                    Write the connected Account and Route as JSON
      --label string            Provider display name
      --model string            Upstream model ID; --upstream-model is the same value
      --openai-url string       OpenAI Responses base URL
      --token-stdin             Read one token line from standard input
      --upstream-model string   Exact provider model ID
-- model.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  --for and --upstream-model are required; --for must be claude, claude-desktop, codex, or hermes; run `aigw add --help`

Impact
  The command could not finish; inspect current state before retrying.

Recommended action
  aigw add --help
